# file: 12_gaps.jx
# title: jx 接受、但 codegen 尚未实现（端到端拒绝）
# desc: 这一批**能通过 jx 编译**（IR 合法、在契约 §3.4 白名单里），但在 `dcg.generate()` 阶段被 codegen 拒绝。属于**未实现**（gap），不是语法错误：用户写出来会拿到 `Unsupported`，所以不会静默出错值。`expect: codegen-reject`。

=== 字面量数组 $sum（codegen 明确拒绝）
expr: $sum([1, 2, 3])
expect: codegen-reject

=== 字面量数组 $min
expr: $min([3, 1, 2])
expect: codegen-reject

=== 字面量数组 $max
expr: $max([3, 1, 2])
expect: codegen-reject

=== 字面量数组 $reverse
expr: $reverse([1, 2, 3])
expect: codegen-reject

=== 字面量数组 $sort
expr: $sort([3, 1, 2])
expect: codegen-reject

=== 字面量数组 $distinct
expr: $distinct([1, 1, 2])
expect: codegen-reject

=== $append（codegen 不认识的列函数）
expr: $append([1], [2])
expect: codegen-reject

=== $replace（codegen 不认识的列函数）
expr: $replace(s, 'a', 'X')
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $substringBefore
expr: $substringBefore(s, '-')
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $substringAfter
expr: $substringAfter(s, '-')
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $pad
expr: $pad(s, 5)
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $base64encode
expr: $base64encode(s)
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $base64decode
expr: $base64decode(s)
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $encodeUrlComponent
expr: $encodeUrlComponent(s)
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $decodeUrlComponent
expr: $decodeUrlComponent(s)
row: {'s': 'a-b'}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $formatNumber
expr: $formatNumber(n, '0.00')
row: {'n': 5.0}
expect: codegen-reject

=== $formatBase
expr: $formatBase(n, 2)
row: {'n': 5.0}
expect: codegen-reject
